 * reader who has never opened this repo, not pasted verbatim — the field
 * table, the env rule, the runbook and the pm2-serve/pm2-runtime deltas all
 * come from that file. The import transcript below is real: run against
 * the test fixture crates/shep-cli/src/commands/import/testdata/dump.pm2.json,
 * which ships in the repo for exactly this kind of demonstration.
 *
 *   ./target/release/shep import \
 *     --from crates/shep-cli/src/commands/import/testdata/dump.pm2.json \
 *     --dry-run
 *
 * Re-run that if the fixture or the importer's notices change, and paste
